#api call for create user account
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user3",
    "email":"user3@gmail.com",
    "password":"password@123"

}

#api call for generate token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user3",
    "password":"password@123"
}

